# Shared demo grammar for every bindings example: comma-separated key:value
# pairs of small integers (alpha:12,beta:3). All examples parse it byte-identically.

Document
| PairList
|

PairList
| Pair PairListTail

PairListTail
| "," PairList
|

Pair
| Key ":" Number

Key@print
| letter KeyTail

KeyTail
| letter KeyTail
| digit KeyTail
|

Number
| digit NumberTail

NumberTail
| digit NumberTail
|
